    <item>
      <title>Short CV</title>
      <link>https://ugoue.github.io/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 09 Apr 2014 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://ugoue.github.io/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I obtained my master in fundamental computer science in 2019 at the ENS de Lyon (France).&lt;br&gt;&#xA;From September 2021 to September 2024, I was a PhD student in the Combinatorial Optimization team of G-SCOP laboratory in Grenoble (France), under the supervision of &lt;a href=&#34;https://oc.g-scop.grenoble-inp.fr/esperet/&#34;&gt;Louis Esperet&lt;/a&gt;, and the co-supervision of &lt;a href=&#34;http://perso.ens-lyon.fr/stephan.thomasse/&#34;&gt;Stéphan Thomassé&lt;/a&gt;. I defended my PhD in Grenoble on the 9th of July 2024.&#xA;I am now currently a postdoctoral research fellow supervised by &lt;a href=&#34;https://page.math.tu-berlin.de/~micek/&#34;&gt;Piotr Micek&lt;/a&gt; at the Jagiellonian university in Kraków (Poland)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
